56, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc146q4.jpg"}], "slug": "sponge-break", "storyline": "Four Sponges are trying to escape from the prison of the kitchen sink. Its a long and dangerous trip. Will they survive?", "summary": "Sponge Break is a physics-based co-op survival game in which one to four players control sponges attempting to escape down a treacherous river aboard a fragile raft, steering through rapids, environmental hazards, and hostile wildlife. It supports drop-in co-op and solo play, and features proximity voice chat with sponges that lip-sync to player speech. Players use a plunger that doubles as a grappling hook, throw loose objects, and store loot in a shared raft stash, while a physics system governs raft handling and damage. Progression is level-based across multiple biomes such as sewers, rivers, and abandoned facilities, with safehouses between levels for repairing, reviving, and restocking, alongside over 100 unlockable cosmetic options, emotes, controller support, and a range of side activities.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 40, "name": "Party"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/sponge-break", "videos": [{"id": 189427, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "W0xT5nqSI7E", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W0xT5nqSI7E", "title": "Sponge Break Reveal Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/W0xT5nqSI7E/uhddefault.jpg"}]}